i opened an issue about this here
https://github.com/Alexey-T/CudaText/issues/6398#top
when cudatext starts and there is a diff tab but the tab is not focused, the _refresh_ex code sets gaps incorrectly because ed.get_wrapinfo() returns nothing , EDACTION_UPDATE did not fix the problem

there a changelog in api that says: fix: Editor.action: EDACTION_UPDATE did not work sometimes (cmd_RepaintEditor worked better)

but ed.cmd(cmd_RepaintEditor) did not fix the problem too

the api says:
Notes:
  - When you perform some caret-positioning command (e.g. "cCommand_GotoTextEnd") in not yet painted editor-control, it doesn't run OK. Reason: editor must be properly inited which happens on first painting. If you need to place the caret on form showing ("dlg_proc" API), do it in form's "on_show" event. Maybe you need also to start a timer ("timer_proc" API) which will run the caret command.

so maybe this is the problem
how can i know that the editor was properly inited? i found no event for that

i used timer_proc to fix it and i wait 20s but get_wrapinfo is always empty, 

get_wrapinfo return data after restart only if the tab is focused which is not a solution because of tabs flickering if i force focus the wanted tabs after restarts

 
